0..75 Comment "// What the naturality square of a region-polymorphic function refuses: the"
76..147 Comment "// square holds only along the outlives extension, and only between one"
148..222 Comment "// function at two regions. `../../model/regions/natural.gandr` states the"
223..233 Comment "// square."
235..313 Comment "// `pass`, which hands back the thunk it is lent, and `touch`, which forces it"
314..355 Comment "// first; each polymorphic in its region."
